{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the twisted minds that brought you Universal Paperclips and Babble Royale comes a timeless tale about numbers going up and going down, the thrill of victory and the agony of defeat, reverse mergers, spooky action at a distance, and a 3-ton whale with a day job. But it's a demo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991960/extras/1e6a5294aebfea6a5184408964f2e5f1.poster.avif?t=1758697945\" width=780 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991960/extras/1e6a5294aebfea6a5184408964f2e5f1.webm?t=1758697945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50/50. Totally random. Totally fair.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You sit down after a tough day to play your favorite video game. Of course you have to wait 10 minutes to get into a match. When you finally do get into a game, you're up against the sweatiest kids you've ever seen. Meanwhile, the idiots on your team have apparently never even <i>heard</i> of a keyboard. After that guaranteed loss, it's another 10 minute wait just to get into a game with someone who screams at you the whole time and then leaves halfway through. As usual, you played your &quot;favorite&quot; video game for the entire night and the only thing you got was mad.\u00a0      <br><br>Sound familiar? We've been there. That's why we made Q-UP! <strong>Every single round of Q-UP is determined by the result of a coin flip</strong>, so every single round of Q-UP is completely fair. No more smurfs ruining your games. No more inters. No more tryhards. No more stupid reaction times or mechanics. Just perfectly fair matches, every single time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991960/extras/6aca790b17b72ab0fcd9d9c1545216d9.avif?t=1758697945\" width=780 height=529 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb (a small part of) the ladder by earning the most Q</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience (the beginning of) a dramatic battle for corporate power in the eSports industry and, if it's not too much trouble, decide the future of the universe</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 (out of 8) playable heroes, each with their own unique skills and abilities</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4v4 team-based competition</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with your friends, Solo-Q, or play the whole game single-player against bots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 200 Items to discover and build around\u00a0(not all of them are in the demo)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 400 skills to unlock\u00a0(the demo has fewer, you get the idea at this point right?)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique geometric trigger-based skill combo system</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Less than) 1.38 \u00d7 10\u00b9\u00b9\u00b2 ways to play!\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991960/extras/f349c67f2bbf062db65f90cbb62f6fc4.poster.avif?t=1758697945\" width=780 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991960/extras/f349c67f2bbf062db65f90cbb62f6fc4.webm?t=1758697945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However you play, you'll experience the heart-stopping thrills of our patented, mathematically-perfect, quantum-powered matchmaking system. Will you make it to the top of the ladder or be trapped forever in Q-Lo hell? Don't ask me! Download the demo and find out!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991960/extras/f6579d5fe287cf640f1dc0739be62491.poster.avif?t=1758697945\" width=780 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991960/extras/f6579d5fe287cf640f1dc0739be62491.webm?t=1758697945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3991960?t=1758697945","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3991960?t=1758697945","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991960/9b5402dff60117e6f4a4c7fabf56e98fad61adef/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758697945","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991960/9b5402dff60117e6f4a4c7fabf56e98fad61adef/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758697945","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Pl